      "id": "word-golpeando--tapping",
      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "golpeando",
      "answerEn": "by tapping; tapping; striking",
      "noteEn": "Golpeando is the action form of golpear ending in -ando. Used without a form of estar, it can explain the action used to accomplish something, much like English “by tapping.”",
      "example": {
        "es": "Probó la pared golpeando suavemente.",
        "en": "She tested the wall by tapping gently."
