      "answerEn": "to do; to perform or play (a tune)",
      "noteEn": "Hacer broadly means “to do” or “to make.” With a routine, imitation, version, or piece of music, it can mean doing or performing it; tocar is the more specific verb for playing an instrument.",
      "example": {
        "es": "El grupo hizo una versión acústica.",
        "en": "The band did an acoustic version."
